1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 8)

3
00:01:55,799 --> 00:01:56,799
Zhou Yang

4
00:01:57,079 --> 00:01:58,079
Zhou Yang is back

5
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:06,439
Zhou Yang

6
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,200
You're back

7
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,400
I'm not Zhou Yang

8
00:02:13,599 --> 00:02:14,680
Haven't seen you in days

9
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,879
You got a bit more handsome

10
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:16,319
What

11
00:02:16,319 --> 00:02:18,376
So if you got handsome,
you're not Zhou Yang anymore

12
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,560
Besides, if you're not Zhou Yang, who are you

13
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:27,479
Oh

14
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,280
The house is a bit messy

15
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:31,319
I haven't really tidied up

16
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,680
Ah

17
00:02:35,199 --> 00:02:37,319
Didn't you say you were only going out for a few days

18
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:39,719
How come you're back so late

19
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,400
I'm not Zhou Yang

20
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,120
A couple days ago

21
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:50,639
Someone found this in an old warehouse

22
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,919
I figured it might be yours

23
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,199
So I brought it over

24
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,560
It really is

25
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:58,800
Look at me

26
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,120
So forgetful

27
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:03,159
Good thing I have you

28
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,960
Hey

29
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,560
You haven't eaten yet, right

30
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,560
Let's eat together

31
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:17,840
You just keep eating this moldy, spoiled stuff

32
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Is it moldy

33
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,056
I think there's still some food in the fridge

34
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,400
Let me cook you a bowl of noodles

35
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:37,440
Maybe I just haven't been
resting well these past few days

36
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,599
Sorry, Yang

37
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:11,960
Bought a bowl of porridge

38
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,120
If I hadn't come today

39
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,720
You'd probably starve to death in this room

40
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:27,919
Then in a few days you'd be on the news headlines

41
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,560
Heh

42
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:21,000
Have you been taking your meds on time

43
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,519
I'm not sick

44
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:31,680
Okay, okay

45
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,839
I'll take them

46
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,600
Yang

47
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,519
Where are you going

48
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,040
I just happened to pass by today

49
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:51,480
I won't come back again

50
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:03,800
And of course Yang won't either

51
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,319
Keep running away

52
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,959
Or wake up and face reality

53
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:10,079
You choose

54
00:06:51,879 --> 00:06:53,680
Did I do something wrong again?

55
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:55,319
That's why Yang left

56
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,560
Maybe I've really lost my mind

57
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,360
But I can't leave

58
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:03,839
I have to wait for him

59
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:07,959
If I leave

60
00:07:08,439 --> 00:07:10,120
Yang won't find me when he comes back

61
00:07:36,199 --> 00:07:37,199
Yang

62
00:07:38,279 --> 00:07:39,279
Yang, you're back

63
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,800
Yang went abroad

64
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,480
He's not coming back

65
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:04,600
Forget him

66
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:09,279
You should start a new life

67
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,879
I'm just glad you're back

68
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,360
I'm just glad you're back

69
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:52,120
You seem to have a fever

70
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,720
Cancel my business trip tomorrow

71
00:09:18,279 --> 00:09:19,279
Something came up

72
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,240
Yang, don't go

73
00:09:42,919 --> 00:09:43,919
Yang

74
00:09:46,279 --> 00:09:47,360
Yang, don't go

75
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,399
Why are you up so early?

76
00:10:18,399 --> 00:10:19,480
Go get some more sleep

77
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,240
With you here, I sleep so soundly

78
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,480
That's why I wake up early

79
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,679
You're still sick

80
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,360
Come on

81
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,320
Sleep a bit more

82
00:11:19,639 --> 00:11:20,639
What's going on

83
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:31,160
Let me tell you again how to take the medicine

84
00:11:32,399 --> 00:11:33,480
Remember it this time

85
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:36,559
This bottle

86
00:11:36,799 --> 00:11:37,960
Take it after meals

87
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,320
Twice a day

88
00:11:39,799 --> 00:11:40,799
Two pills each time

89
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,919
This bottle is for bedtime every night

90
00:11:44,039 --> 00:11:45,360
One pill each time is enough

91
00:11:45,639 --> 00:11:46,639
And also

92
00:11:51,279 --> 00:11:52,279
Got all that?

93
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,480
Mm

94
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,600
These

95
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,480
Oh

96
00:12:00,159 --> 00:12:01,559
Your place is way too messy

97
00:12:02,799 --> 00:12:04,279
Even I can't stand it

98
00:12:05,159 --> 00:12:06,360
I'll come by in three days

99
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,240
Take you to the hospital for a checkup

100
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,120
You're leaving again?

101
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:17,000
Something came up at the company

102
00:12:21,679 --> 00:12:22,679
Ma'am

103
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:26,080
Could I trouble you to come cook for the next few days

104
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,399
Just send me the bill

105
00:12:29,399 --> 00:12:30,399
Okay

106
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:32,960
Yang

107
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:42,720
Stop talking

108
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:48,080
Remember to take your medicine after you eat

109
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:06,360
Didn't he say he'd come in three days

110
00:13:08,519 --> 00:13:09,840
Why isn't he here yet

111
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,200
Why are you here

112
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:24,039
We agreed I'd bring you for a checkup in three days

113
00:13:26,519 --> 00:13:27,879
I don't even remember

114
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,440
I was sleeping

115
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,559
You sleep dressed this formally?

116
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,440
Ah

117
00:13:40,159 --> 00:13:41,600
Come on, give me some dignity

118
00:13:41,879 --> 00:13:44,015
Otherwise I'd have to say
I've been waiting for you this whole time

119
00:13:44,039 --> 00:13:45,039
So embarrassing

120
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,080
Mr. Shen

121
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,480
And this is

122
00:13:55,039 --> 00:13:56,039
This is Zhou Yang

123
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,480
He's my love

124
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,600
But from what I know

125
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:03,559
Mr. Zhou Yang doesn't look like this

126
00:14:03,559 --> 00:14:05,759
And he's not as tall as this gentleman either

127
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,240
Doctor

128
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,600
People change

129
00:14:11,759 --> 00:14:13,200
He went abroad

130
00:14:13,799 --> 00:14:15,200
Of course he'd change

131
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:19,720
And no matter what he becomes

132
00:14:20,159 --> 00:14:21,440
I'll always recognize him

133
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,039
So, Mr. Shen

134
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:32,480
Are you sure this man next to you is Zhou Yang?

135
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,240
Of course

136
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,960
How many years have we known each other?

137
00:14:37,759 --> 00:14:38,480
No, doctor

138
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,519
The questions you're asking today

139
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:41,039
Why are they all so strange?

140
00:14:42,279 --> 00:14:43,320
Alright, Mr. Shen

141
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:44,360
I understand

142
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:48,600
Shen Mo

143
00:14:49,679 --> 00:14:51,399
Wait outside for me for a bit

144
00:14:52,279 --> 00:14:53,440
I'll be right there

145
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:56,960
Oh

146
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:06,720
Mr. Ji

147
00:15:06,759 --> 00:15:07,799
You saw it too

148
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,360
Mr. Shen's condition

149
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,360
Just tell me straight

150
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:14,679
The patient has a very severe post-traumatic stress reaction

151
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,039
Deep down

152
00:15:16,039 --> 00:15:17,200
he's been running from it

153
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:19,000
the fact that Yang abandoned him

154
00:15:19,559 --> 00:15:21,960
So he takes you, who's by his side

155
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,639
as a stand-in for Yang

156
00:15:24,279 --> 00:15:26,879
This is Mr. Shen's self-protection mechanism

157
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:29,960
I understand

158
00:15:30,679 --> 00:15:32,480
But if you don't expose him

159
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,759
and don't tell him the truth

160
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:37,120
it could get worse and worse

161
00:15:37,279 --> 00:15:40,960
he might even see you as Zhou Yang forever

162
00:15:42,279 --> 00:15:44,480
So what happens if I do expose him

163
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:45,919
He might break down

164
00:15:46,559 --> 00:15:48,559
Or he might be fine

165
00:15:49,159 --> 00:15:50,399
No one can say for sure

166
00:15:51,879 --> 00:15:53,960
Then how do we treat it

167
00:15:55,159 --> 00:15:58,480
Healing a mental illness is a long process

168
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:01,519
And no one can guarantee it'll work

169
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:04,559
All you can do is stay by his side

170
00:16:04,559 --> 00:16:04,960
Oh

171
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:05,240
Right

172
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:05,960
Remember

173
00:16:06,039 --> 00:16:08,919
You must keep his emotions stable

174
00:16:09,919 --> 00:16:11,080
That's all for now

175
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:16,080
He can't take another breakdown right now

176
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:17,720
Mr. Ji

177
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:19,840
I still want to remind you

178
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,519
You'd better think it through

179
00:16:30,559 --> 00:16:31,639
I owe him

180
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:36,519
Done talking

181
00:16:36,679 --> 00:16:37,679
Mm

182
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,080
What did you two talk about?

183
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,279
The doctor said you're fine

184
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:45,039
Just take your meds on time

185
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,399
See, I told you

186
00:16:47,639 --> 00:16:49,679
Doctors always have to ask this and that

187
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,240
Don't worry

188
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,559
I'm not worried at all

189
00:16:53,559 --> 00:16:54,559
Let's go

190
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,440
Yang

191
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:58,440
Where are we going?

192
00:16:59,799 --> 00:17:00,799
Taking you home

193
00:17:01,799 --> 00:17:02,799
You're so good to me

194
00:17:37,799 --> 00:17:38,960
Sorry about that

195
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,400
I think I fell asleep

196
00:17:45,359 --> 00:17:46,640
Why are we pulled over?

197
00:17:48,759 --> 00:17:49,960
Didn't want to wake you

198
00:17:51,079 --> 00:17:52,079
Had a nightmare

199
00:17:56,559 --> 00:17:57,559
Often?

200
00:17:59,519 --> 00:18:00,519
Now and then

201
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,640
Look at me

202
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:08,000
You've been looking so pale lately

203
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:10,136
Is it because you're scared to sleep

204
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:10,920
No

205
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:11,920
Then why

206
00:18:13,039 --> 00:18:14,720
It's just that when I close my eyes

207
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:16,480
I see all these strange

208
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:17,519
terrifying dreams

209
00:18:19,319 --> 00:18:20,480
Why didn't you tell me

210
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,839
I didn't want you to worry

211
00:18:23,759 --> 00:18:25,200
Has it been like this every night

212
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,799
Not always

213
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:31,079
Last time you stayed with me, I could sleep

214
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:49,039
Yang

215
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,240
Where are we going

216
00:18:50,559 --> 00:18:52,159
You're driving the wrong way, aren't you

217
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:53,720
No, I'm not

218
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,720
Then where are we going

219
00:18:57,359 --> 00:18:58,359
My place

220
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:01,359
You shouldn't be alone in that room

221
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,400
No

222
00:19:02,559 --> 00:19:03,559
Why

223
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,240
No

224
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,680
I have to go home

225
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:07,680
I still have to wait

226
00:19:15,839 --> 00:19:16,839
Wait

227
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:17,880
Waiting for what

228
00:19:18,079 --> 00:19:19,079
Waiting for Yang

229
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:21,079
But Yang is already by my side

230
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,640
Then what am I waiting for

231
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,200
You really won't come with me

232
00:19:29,799 --> 00:19:30,799
Yang

233
00:19:32,559 --> 00:19:34,039
Let's go home, okay

234
00:19:35,119 --> 00:19:36,759
It's our home

235
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:40,480
Okay

236
00:19:43,599 --> 00:19:44,599
Back to your home

237
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:45,720
What do you mean, your home

238
00:19:46,119 --> 00:19:47,559
What are you talking about

239
00:19:48,799 --> 00:19:50,119
That's our home

240
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:26,960
The ferris wheel spins but never reaches the clouds

241
00:20:27,279 --> 00:20:29,799
We sit side by side

242
00:20:29,799 --> 00:20:34,759
Only seeing each other's loneliness

243
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:38,119
That beautiful place

244
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:42,599
Is probably still on the next round

245
00:20:42,839 --> 00:20:48,599
Too bad no one has the strength to wait for it to turn

246
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:57,840
How come you walk without making a sound

247
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,400
It's beautiful

248
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,640
That's not what you used to say

249
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:07,440
You even said you'd teach me

250
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,480
I really like it

251
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:12,920
Really

252
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:15,160
Then I'll sing it for you all the time, okay

253
00:21:15,599 --> 00:21:16,599
Okay

254
00:21:17,599 --> 00:21:18,920
But it's really late now

255
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:21,000
You should go to sleep

256
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:24,160
Okay

257
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,000
Yang

258
00:21:44,119 --> 00:21:45,400
Why won't you sleep with me

259
00:21:47,279 --> 00:21:48,359
Don't ask so many questions

260
00:21:49,119 --> 00:21:50,759
Did you forget something

261
00:21:51,039 --> 00:21:52,039
Mm

262
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:55,880
Did you forget to take your medicine

263
00:22:28,839 --> 00:22:30,359
Were you always this obedient before

264
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:32,200
Don't you know how I used to be

265
00:22:32,319 --> 00:22:33,519
Is there a big difference

266
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:38,680
Never mind

267
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:39,920
Let's sleep

268
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:41,920
Okay

269
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:43,480
Good night

270
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,480
Good night

271
00:23:14,119 --> 00:23:15,480
In your eyes

272
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:17,680
Is everyone Yang

273
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:20,319
Or do you only see me as him

274
00:23:21,200 --> 00:23:22,319
I like you

275
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:27,240
Yang

276
00:23:31,039 --> 00:23:32,039
I'm right here

277
00:23:32,519 --> 00:23:33,519
Go to sleep

278
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:40,720
You're awake

279
00:23:41,319 --> 00:23:42,359
Get up and eat

280
00:23:49,400 --> 00:23:51,039
Try it, see if my cooking's improved

281
00:24:19,119 --> 00:24:20,119
Is it good?

282
00:24:23,119 --> 00:24:24,119
Just okay

283
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:27,599
Well, it can't compare to fancy delicacies

284
00:24:45,799 --> 00:24:46,799
Mr. Ji

285
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:50,599
Mr. Ji

286
00:24:50,599 --> 00:24:51,599
Take a look

287
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:53,640
Enough

288
00:24:53,880 --> 00:24:55,000
Handle it yourself

289
00:25:12,279 --> 00:25:13,399
What are you thinking about?

290
00:25:15,319 --> 00:25:16,440
I was thinking

291
00:25:17,319 --> 00:25:18,759
Why won't you sleep with me

292
00:25:22,039 --> 00:25:22,519
Uh

293
00:25:22,519 --> 00:25:23,879
You're still not over your illness

294
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:24,599
I

295
00:25:24,599 --> 00:25:24,920
Ah

296
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:25,976
I've just been too busy with work

297
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:26,680
This

298
00:25:26,960 --> 00:25:28,360
This couch is actually pretty comfy

299
00:25:29,640 --> 00:25:31,640
You're sleeping with me tonight, no matter what

300
00:25:45,880 --> 00:25:46,880
I'm impotent

301
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,440
Happy now

